        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the depths of space, speed is everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>OutSpaceX</i> is a high-speed space racing game that blends futuristic aesthetics with adrenaline-pumping competition. Take control of advanced anti-gravity vehicles equipped with particle thrusters and race through treacherous interstellar tracks filled with sharp turns, cosmic hazards, and breathtaking visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re drifting along asteroid fields, navigating high-temperature orbits near stars, or soaring through zero-gravity zones, each course offers a unique blend of challenge and spectacle. Dynamic track events, environmental anomalies, and cosmic landscapes ensure that no two races ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against AI pilots from across the galaxy in a thrilling solo experience, or compete online in multiplayer matches to prove you’re the fastest in the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[W] Throttle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[A] Brake</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[S][D] Turn Left / Right</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Space] Nitro Boost</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Enter] Confirm</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[A] Cancel</strong></p></li></ul>",
